ould use a time splinter definitely an interesting idea. Currently debating on how the Machine would communicate with Adam.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-03T21:08:57-07:00","id":881467,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xenoterracide</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/880707-god-and-demons-of-biblical-proportions?p=881368#post881368\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> yeah I've had some consideration that the Fruit is the linchpin, maybe to concealment infrastructure... could use a time splinter definitely an interesting idea. Currently debating on how the Machine would communicate with Adam.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Wouldn't, strictly speaking, It not, but Its Messengers would?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T06:49:33-07:00","id":881735,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/880707-god-and-demons-of-biblical-proportions?p=881467#post881467\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Wouldn't, strictly speaking, It not, but Its Messengers would?</div> </div> </div> </div>Doesn't mean, however unlikely, that it couldn't implant it's missive's directly in Adam's head <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T07:09:07-07:00","id":881746,"title":"","content":"Also, just as hell is seen as the absence of God, Heaven is meant to be the presence of God. It wouldn't surprise me if parts of the GM would actually be physically visible there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T07:45:18-07:00","id":881777,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maitrecorbo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/880707-god-and-demons-of-biblical-proportions?p=881746#post881746\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, just as hell is seen as the absence of God, Heaven is meant to be the presence of God. It wouldn't surprise me if parts of the GM would actually be physically visible there.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wouldn't <i>that</i> make Adam and Eve (and etc.) inherently Stigmatic? Only by being &quot;cast out&quot; would non-Stigmatic humans exist...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T10:21:06-07:00","id":881949,"title":"","content":"my thinking is not really supported by the canon :P. but i like the idea of the God Machine and heaven being in the future and hes working to retoactively make sure he end up existing. <br /> Adam and Eve (in that scenario) are more the only human left, who are stimatic.<br /> Then again, its only headcanon so ... take it with a grain of salt <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-13T06:03:38-07:00","id":889822,"title":"","content":"Okay, then! Time for my thoughts! Its been a while, but the time has come to explain myself.<br /> <br /> First and foremost, I feel that the most important thing to making Demon the Descent &quot;biblical&quot; is to start with the base setting. Devils, succubus, fallen grigori*, flaming lionheaded wheels with leg-spokes, and imps. These are perhaps better known by their actual game names, Destroyer, Messnanger, Guardian, Psychopomp and Analyst. When you are making NPCs, make them in the form of archetypical demons that we expect from popular culture and real world lore. Yes, Demon Forms and Embeds/Exploits are highly customizable, but for now, lets stick with something that you can expect to see from a novel or video game demon. Spindle (goat) legs, bat wings, horns, tail, red skin, fiery mantle for hair are quite common. The grigori are watcher angels who saw humans, fell in love, and thus fell. Guardians are literally designed to watch over humans, and falling in love (or hate, or something) is a common cause of falling. They're the same story, so put the emphasis on those stories. Devil-destroyers that hate God and want to kill it. The sly seducer-succubus who takes you to bed as the man of your dreams in exchange for your soul. <br /> <br /> There is a lot of biblical stuff in the base character creation. Find those bits and emphasize them in your NPCs. <br /> <br /> While the ring is generally the basic organization of demons from the game design standpoint, and the book talks about paranoia and not trusting other demons? I feel that doesn't quite bear out in real games. In a lot of the sample settings, Agencies are everywhere. And, if not an Agency, then a ring that's large enough that it could break into separate but allied Rings and become one. Tempters, by necessity, are organized into some kind of network - their Condition doesn't work otherwise. So, make use of this. Organize demon lords ruling over these different factions as they deal with the ongoing war against God. Show the Tempters working the Faustian angle. Work the Sabatours as the soldiers against God, the Paranoids as the mystics seeking the truth of what happened. Be sure to include some subverted Infrastructure like fiery forges that can resemble hellfire, golden roads and pearly gates that double as massive eldritch circuit boards with sparking Essence energy. <br /> <br /> The so-called Turncoats are harder to pull off, as they're the repentant angel archetype in a game where angels are unsympathetic beings. Its hard to play up the begging for forgiveness angle when God collects and converts as a matter of course. Its still possible from another angle - forget the begging and faith, and focus on the humanity. Play the preacher who faith heals, does good works, seeks to uplift and unite humanity. The Integrator's Hell is to create a social revolution through diplomacy and changing the Laws of heaven. Show cases where its possible for an angel to ascend from being a demon, but with their memory and persona intact, with projects that go out of their way to minimize suffering of the humans involved. The God Machine isn't evil - it just lacks empathy. If enough angels focused on minimizing damage rather than expediency, then it literally would make the God Machine into a caring God. The books tend to display the Turncoats in a bad light, but I think its important to show that Integrators aren't always the traitors to watch out for, and to make angels capable of infiltrating demon organizations on their own as well. <br /> <br /> --------------------------------------------------------------------<br /> <br /> Now, for God itself. Now, the Machine represents Order. This entire game is a war between Heaven and &quot;Hell,&quot; angels versus demons, but this isn't Good versus Evil. Its not even Grey versus Black. This is Order versus Free Will, Law versus Chaos, Security versus Freedom. As such, it should be notable that angels run the gamut between actually nice and helpful people that adhere to the rules as well as dangerous psychopaths who abuse the rules for their own pleasure. Feel free to show &quot;classical angels&quot; alongside the others.<br /> <br /> Anyways, like with demons, there's a lot here that's already biblical, but hidden behind Technobable terms.<ul><li> Infrastructure is nothing more than a fancy name for &quot;touched by God.&quot; When demons sense Infrastructure, have it described in terms of &quot;blessed by God,&quot; or &quot;holy ground.&quot; Cultists that are blessed (enhanced) by God, consecrated ground, holy relics and more should make an appearance. I designed &quot;holy water&quot; that, when splashed on a demon, caused Comprise checks and called down avenging angels.</li> <li> &quot;Occult matrix&quot; is nothing more than a fancy term for a magic ritual. Or sacrament, if you want more religious overtones. You get the right people (chosen of God) in the right place (geomantic conversion / holy ground) with the right time (astrology / the stars align).</li> <li> Don't worry about things like Linchpins and the names of different kinds of Infrastructure. That's really unnecessary - the important thing to keep in mind is that, for everything God is doing, there's a way to stop it. Just as Angels are all unique and don't fit into categories nicely, so you shouldn't try to shoehorn Infrastructure into four or five types. Go with what feels natural in the story and don't try to shoehorn.</li> <li> Drop &quot;God works in mysterious ways&quot; a few times when talking about hiding from humanity. You'll be amazed at how much simple statements like that can help set the tone.</li> <li> Don't be afraid to go wild with Possessions and summons. Yes, its ironic that angels are the ones who possess people and are called up by the cult rituals, and the reverse expectations might be hard to grasp. So, feel free to treat some demonic-themed Exiles to help highlight the contrast. Manifestations are for short term appearances, Possessions are long term appearances.</li> <li> Back to Infrastructures. Remember how I mentioned that occult matricies happen at &quot;holy grounds&quot; and geomantic conversions? Place those in churches or dens of inquity, or something else that's appropriately thematic. And make sure that they run with Heaven, Hell, Underworld, etc imagery.</li> </ul><br /> <br /> ---------------------------------------------------------------------<br /> <br /> Now, with all that established! Some ideas for stories:<ul><li>Time travel and alternate dimensions. Ever since &quot;Its a Wonderful Life,&quot; this has been a classic angel move. Take Stigmatics out of one timeline and drop them into another to show the cost of actions. I did this once as a short plot - a bunch of Sabatours were crushing Infrastructure in Vegas, and they were working towards hitting a major linchpin that would set off the entire San Andrias Fault in a massive, massive earthquake. In responce? The God-Machine sent an undercover Stigmatic (or Fractal, if you wish) back in time to prevent this disaster.</li> <li>God Saves! Just as the Y2K bug in Seattle needed an angel to solve things so that the world won't end, so too does Global Warming need a new angel to protect humanity from killing themselves off. And we're not just talking about a summoning. We need a new one custom built. What kinds of sacrifices are people willing to make to save the world from a man-made Armegeddon? Who needs to die for the sake of humanity's sins against the planet? Great for messiah stories.</li> <li>The Pain Prophet was right, there are hidden Archangels on the moon. Except they're not angels anymore, they're Exiles. And one of them, in the guise of the Lightbringer Lucifer, is going to decend upon Earth. This is bad for both the Angels and Unchained - the former because it will destroy their projects, endanger their charges, potentially subvert entire Infrastructure by the sheer shift in the flows of Essence. And the latter, because faux-Lucifer naturally degrades Covers by its mere presence and Essence warping. The problem? As an Exile, the God-Machine can't do crap against this - play up reasons why God ignores Exiles here. So, individual angels and demons need to join forces against a common threat.</li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-13T07:38:41-07:00","id":889879,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2102_3.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2102\" data-vbnamecard=\"2102\">MCN</a> Great advice. And it involves no actual changes to the game mechanics, just presentation/rebranding.<br /> <br /> Something to keep in mind with Angels and &quot;Mysterious Ways&quot;: They don't actually &quot;talk&quot; to God. They are given their mission and all the knowledge they need to fulfill it (as determined by the boss)... but not why. And theirs' is not the place to ask.<br /> <br /> For Integrators, you might change <i>why</i> Demon's get hauled back in - It is not so much because they are Demons, as because they break the Laws. Compromise isn't merely what makes you more likely to be found out, it is <i>why</i> you need to hide to begin with (Breaking the Masquerade might be against the Law, as are the other sources of Compromise). Integrators don't want to be punished, they want to find out how to be <i>forgiven</i>.<br /> <br /> On that note, Exiles might represent disappointment, or even a kind of &quot;hands off&quot; encouragement, without it going as far as Disobey-&gt;Wrath-&gt;Fall.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-13T08:18:39-07:00","id":889911,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/880707-god-and-demons-of-biblical-proportions?p=889879#post889879\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2102_3.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2102\" data-vbnamecard=\"2102\">MCN</a> Great advice. And it involves no actual changes to the game mechanics, just presentation/rebranding.<br /> <br /> Something to keep in mind with Angels and &quot;Mysterious Ways&quot;: They don't actually &quot;talk&quot; to God. They are given their mission and all the knowledge they need to fulfill it (as determined by the boss)... but not why. And theirs' is not the place to ask.</div> </div> </div> </div> First, let me point out that angels can querry the God Machine for more information. Wither or not they get it is questionable, but it is still possible. <br /> <br /> Well, this is actually where the comparisons to the biblical God falls apart. God isn't a discrete being like the Paternoster Exarch. You won't find a rank 10 angel in charge of everything. God is like the internet - its everywhere, and made up of millions of computers, routers, wiring, signals, servers, &quot;clouds&quot; and more. When you get information off the internet, you send out a general search through Google (because other search engines don't exist <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />), and get told where you can find said information in places. Now, put Skynet into the Internet to copy itself a million fold, and give all that information direction and a Mission. That's the God Machine. God isn't a single discrete part, its the sum of every Infrastructure, stigmatic cultist, angel and relic. This is the CofD meaning behind &quot;God is everywhere.&quot; Because angels and Infrastructure are everywhere, and God is every one of them.<br /> <br /> This actually is more interesting, I find, than a discrete but all powerful being. You can actually have a Council of Angels or a pantheon of gods as a stand in for the God- they go down, the local Command / Control structure fails to work, and the local G-M ceases to operate. Hell achieved, God is dead (zones).<br /> <br /> The God Machine is mroe than just the Christian God. Its the Laws of Heaven as described by Confusious. Its the Hindu gods and their guiding hand over the fate of their people. When God is a machine, you can take it as a whole, or take it down bit by bit. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> For Integrators, you might change <i>why</i> Demon's get hauled back in - It is not so much because they are Demons, as because they break the Laws. </div> </div> </div> Part of the reason why the God Machine &quot;hates&quot; demons isn't because they rejected God, or even that they're wasted resources. No, its because demons are Unchained from it. Every other person in the world is connected to God, and part of its calculations. Demons are outside those calculations, and can do whatever they want, which messes up the G-M's careful calculations. So, yes. By merely existing, demons mess up the Divine Mission. When they play the part of an average person, its easier to slip into the variables. Breaking the &quot;divine law,&quot; however, causes major changes to the flow of Fate in the world.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-13T08:49:49-07:00","id":889942,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/880707-god-and-demons-of-biblical-proportions?p=889911#post889911\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> First, let me point out that angels can querry the God Machine for more information. Wither or not they get it is questionable, but it is still possible.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's also the question of whether it is <i>truthful</i>, but we'll leave that aside for the moment.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/880707-god-and-demons-of-biblical-proportions?p=889911#post889911\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, this is actually where the comparisons to the biblical God falls apart. God isn't a discrete being like the Paternoster Exarch. You won't find a rank 10 angel in charge of everything. God is like the internet - its everywhere, and made up of millions of computers, routers, wiring, signals, servers, &quot;clouds&quot; and more. When you get information off the internet, you send out a general search through Google (because other search engines don't exist <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />), and get told where you can find said information in places. Now, put Skynet into the Internet to copy itself a million fold, and give all that information direction and a Mission. That's the God Machine. God isn't a single discrete part, its the sum of every Infrastructure, stigmatic cultist, angel and relic. This is the CofD meaning behind &quot;God is everywhere.&quot; Because angels and Infrastructure are everywhere, and God is every one of them.<br /> <br /> This actually is more interesting, I find, than a discrete but all powerful being. You can actually have a Council of Angels or a pantheon of gods as a stand in for the God- they go down, the local Command / Control structure fails to work, and the local G-M ceases to operate. Hell achieved, God is dead (zones).<br /> <br /> The God Machine is mroe than just the Christian God. Its the Laws of Heaven as described by Confusious. Its the Hindu gods and their guiding hand over the fate of their people. When God is a machine, you can take it as a whole, or take it down bit by bit.</div> </div> </div> </div><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I know - that's why I like it. Despite some people's perceptions that it, as a &quot;machine&quot; is thus inferior or simpler to understand, it is (for me anyways) <i>grander</i>.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/880707-god-and-demons-of-biblical-proportions?p=889911#post889911\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Part of the reason why the God Machine &quot;hates&quot; demons isn't because they rejected God, or even that they're wasted resources. No, its because demons are Unchained from it. Every other person in the world is connected to God, and part of its calculations. Demons are outside those calculations, and can do whatever they want, which messes up the G-M's careful calculations. So, yes. By merely existing, demons mess up the Divine Mission. When they play the part of an average person, its easier to slip into the variables. Breaking the &quot;divine law,&quot; however, causes major changes to the flow of Fate in the world.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know. This is just more presentation and focus - are you being hunted at all times because of risk, or are you tolerated until you screw something up? It's a thin line that is irrelevant for most Demons anyways. They meddle.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-13T16:01:57-07:00","id":890211,"title":"","content":"I dunno, I wouldn't say the God-Machine hates demons. I think it's more like:<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, there are those parts of Me that are not part of Me right not. I'll fix that later. First I have to go tell these cultists to wave a copy of Cosmo at a gossipy old lady across the street, who in her geriatric haste to get the magazine will cause a bus to swerve 6.1 inches to the right to avoid her, which will then scare some birds, who will then crap on a man's windshield, which will cause him to be distracted long enough to jump the curb and knock over a trashcan that is home to three rats carrying a specially tailored bioweapon in their bloodstream that I designed. Those rats will then infest three homes and bite the children residing there, who will die three days later after singing an eldritch equation in Hebrew backwards- thus completing the Occult Matrix.&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-13T17:29:10-07:00","id":890279,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/880707-god-and-demons-of-biblical-proportions?p=889911#post889911\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Part of the reason why the God Machine &quot;hates&quot; demons isn't because they rejected God, or even that they're wasted resources. No, its because demons are Unchained from it. Every other person in the world is connected to God, and part of its calculations. Demons are outside those calculations, and can do whatever they want, which messes up the G-M's careful calculations. So, yes. By merely existing, demons mess up the Divine Mission. When they play the part of an average person, its easier to slip into the variables. Breaking the &quot;divine law,&quot; however, causes major changes to the flow of Fate in the world.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, not every person. What makes the Unchained specially worth hunting is two things: (1) what you said, the chaotic loose cannon, but also (2) they can be brought back in. The hunter angels aren't sent because the Unchained are particularly hated; they're sent because the Unchained can be re-Chained with minimal fuss.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I call the Integrity-analogue the &quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/822559-trying-to-understand-the-morality-system?p=825008#post825008\" target=\"_blank\">subjective stat</a>&quot;.<br /> An explanation how to <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/913221-using-social-manuevering\" target=\"_blank\">use Social Manuevering</a>.<br /> Guanxi Explanations: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=787824#post787824\" target=\"_blank\">1</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=788173#post788173\" target=\"_blank\">2</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/833863-mages-and-trading-favors?p=834531#post834531\" target=\"_blank\">3</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2758-errol216","name":"Errol216","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T00:08:10-07:00","id":890467,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/880707-god-and-demons-of-biblical-proportions?p=889911#post889911\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This actually is more interesting, I find, than a discrete but all powerful being. You can actually have a Council of Angels or a pantheon of gods as a stand in for the God- they go down, the local Command / Control structure fails to work, and the local G-M ceases to operate. Hell achieved, God is dead (zones).<br /> <br /> The God Machine is mroe than just the Christian God. Its the Laws of Heaven as described by Confusious. Its the Hindu gods and their guiding hand over the fate of their people. When God is a machine, you can take it as a whole, or take it down bit by bit.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why do you think that the Christian God is a discrete being? I'm not a believer but... a god, any god, would likely have to be at least a 5th dimensional being, and an allegedly omipresent god would have to be some kind of massive at least. You can put a face on the G-M too, but that doesn't necessarily make it so.<br /> <br /> Anyways sorry 'bout the slacking on the first of these...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T08:44:20-07:00","id":890585,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/880707-god-and-demons-of-biblical-proportions?p=890211#post890211\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I dunno, I wouldn't say the God-Machine hates demons.</div> </div> </div> </div> The God Machine as a whole is technically incapable of the emotion of hate. That's why I put the word &quot;hate&quot; in quotations. But, make no mistake, the God-Machine absolutely does not want demons running around for more reasons than just seeing them as malfunctioning parts. Demons actively interfere in Its Missions, even when the Unchained try to stay away. Like I said, that's part of the reason.<br /> <br /> Yes, recapture and reintegrate is another part, but that is one that everyone focuses on. I want to highlight parts of the story that people often ignore and gloss over. And &quot;turn you back into Angels&quot; is less stereotypical biblical demon than &quot;Demons corrupt the world and upset the God's Plan by their mere presence.&quot;<br /> <br /> Edit- Furhtermore, while the God Machine does reintegrate angels, it also has Hunter Angels that just utterly destroy demons rather than let them roam around free or reintegration. This leads me to believe that reclaiming resources is actually a side benefit rather than the main reason in many cases.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xenoterracide</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/880707-god-and-demons-of-biblical-proportions?p=890467#post890467\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why do you think that the Christian God is a discrete being?</div> </div> </div> </div> Because that's how the general population in the real world treats God. Anything more esoteric is going to be less useful for purpose of this discussion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2102,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","user":"MCN","date":". 05-14-2016, 11:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T12:34:31-07:00","id":890713,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/880707-god-and-demons-of-biblical-proportions?p=890585#post890585\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Because that's how the general population in the real world treats God. Anything more esoteric is going to be less useful for purpose of this discussion.</div> </div> </div> </div> I mean sorta they do... they also think of him as omnipresent which means they think of him as being everywhere. Sure they don't think of him as a collective intelligence (multiple as one), though I have heard the &quot;all gods&quot; are just faces (facets? like a jewel) of the one god theory. I'm just having trouble associating &quot;omnipresent&quot; with people think of god as a &quot;discrete&quot; being.<br /> <br /> Update: I would never treat the God Machine as either omnipotent, or omnipresent<br /> Update2: People think that the &quot;Internet&quot; or &quot;Cloud&quot; is a discrete thing too, and conceptually it is... sorta, practically it's not.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":4046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","user":"xenoterracide","date":". 05-14-2016, 03:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T13:56:36-07:00","id":890775,"title":"","content":"*shrugs* People think of an old man on a throne with a white beard and hair, or Morgan Freeman, or something like that when they think of &quot;God.&quot; That's all I meant. In either case, debating real world theology has nothing to do with Demon or the God Machine. The Christian God doesn't rely on Command and Control Centers for brains, doesn't need angels for fingers and eyes, isn't described in terms of employing human sacrifice or needing humans to carry out its work. The God-Machine will die if you destroy all its Infrastructure. No Christian will believe that God will die even if you blow up the world and all the angels. <br /> <br /> While there are a lot of comparisons we can make between Christian angels and God-Machine angels, comparisons between the Christan God and the God-Machine fall flat. And you know what? That's fine. When God does show up in stories, its never as an active force. A mentor, a guide, something like that. God is never the one being directly challenged, its always something or someone else. That's why the emphasis on angels (and perhaps Stigamtics and Fractals)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-15T10:01:08-07:00","id":891213,"title":"","content":"Much as playing theologian is fun, what happened to retelling Bible stories in terms of Descent?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I call the Integrity-analogue the &quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/822559-trying-to-understand-the-morality-system?p=825008#post825008\" target=\"_blank\">subjective stat</a>&quot;.<br /> An explanation how to <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/913221-using-social-manuevering\" target=\"_blank\">use Social Manuevering</a>.<br /> Guanxi Explanations: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=787824#post787824\" target=\"_blank\">1</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=788173#post788173\" target=\"_blank\">2</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/833863-mages-and-trading-favors?p=834531#post834531\" target=\"_blank\">3</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2758-errol216","name":"Errol216","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-15T11:20:39-07:00","id":891269,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Errol216</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/880707-god-and-demons-of-biblical-proportions?p=891213#post891213\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Much as playing theologian is fun, what happened to retelling Bible stories in terms of Descent?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Animatrix I suppose<br /> <br /> Joking aside, Old Testament offers plenty of opportunity for hijinks","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-15T11:25:13-07:00","id":891272,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/880707-god-and-demons-of-biblical-proportions?p=890775#post890775\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">*shrugs* People think of an old man on a throne with a white beard and hair, or Morgan Freeman, or something like that when they think of &quot;God.&quot; That's all I meant.</div> </div> </div> </div> I've never thought of either of these things, I picture God as a being who appears as whatever that brings awe, joy, comfort, and righteous fear ( in a benign way, due to his immensity and our inability to truly comprehend something so infinite) to the individual <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-15T11:34:51-07:00","id":891282,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"https://media0.giphy.com/media/1373tll6MDopZC/200_s.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2102,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","user":"MCN","date":". 05-15-2016, 02:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-15T14:01:17-07:00","id":891353,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Errol216</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/880707-god-and-demons-of-biblical-proportions?p=891213#post891213\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Much as playing theologian is fun, what happened to retelling Bible stories in terms of Descent?</div> </div> </div> </div>I got lazy, and no one is working on a different story which would be awesome! also I've been muddling around whether I want to do a narrative story or playable scenario, or written as a playable scenario that has forgone conclusions about character actions.<br /> <br /> It's also worth saying I'm not a writer... well at least not a non technical writer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":4046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","user":"xenoterracide","date":". 05-15-2016, 05:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.t